  "details": "<p>For this entry in the \"Unlocated Toponyms\" list in the <em>Map-by-Map Directory</em> for the <em>Barrington Atlas</em> Map 55, Fossey and Morin cite St\u00e4hlin 1924, but the relevant section thereof is entirely about <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/540905\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">the well-known Thessalian Larissa (modern Larisa in Greece)</a>.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
